### Step 1: Bug Scenario Image Analysis

The image shows a CLI run of Lighthouse with the command:
```
node lighthouse-cli www.example.com --view
```
The error output is:
```
Runtime error encountered: lighthouse-core/lib/lh-error.js | urlInvalid # 0
LHError: INVALID_URL
